# New Cars, Used Cars, On Road Price, Buy Car, Sell Your Car - CarWale

CarWale is one of India's most trusted automotive platforms, offering both new and used cars, and is a leading authority on new car pricing. It sources real-time price data for new cars from over 798 dealers across 1538 cities, while also providing a used car marketplace with 100% verified car options. Every new car price is verified by CarWale, ensuring high accuracy and transparency, and helping users confidently compare options and buy the right car at the right price.

